window.__BRAND__={"hi":{"Menu":"Menu","Settings":"Settings","Learn more":"Aur jaano","Our companies":"Hamari companies","Founded by Misbah Raza":"Misbah Raza ki company","The parent company behind NextEdit Agency, Mxa AI and a growing family of studios — building AI systems, software, websites, apps, video and design from Govindpur, Dhanbad.":"NextEdit Agency, Mxa AI aur kai studios ki parent company — Govindpur, Dhanbad se AI systems, software, websites, apps, video aur design banate hain.","One name. Infinite future.":"Ek naam. Anant bhavishya.","Companies":"Companies","One name. Many companies.":"Ek naam. <em>Kai companies.</em>","Every company under QENLYX has one job and does it properly. Tap any card to see its full page.":"QENLYX ki har company ka ek kaam hai, aur woh use achhe se karti hai. Card dabao, poora page khulega.","Explore":"Dekho","Founder":"Founder","Meet the founder":"Founder se milo","Video editor, graphic designer and builder of AI apps and websites — the founder of QENLYX, NextEdit Agency and Mxa AI, from Govindpur, Dhanbad.":"Video editor, graphic designer aur AI apps + websites banane wala — QENLYX, NextEdit Agency aur Mxa AI ka founder, Govindpur, Dhanbad se.","Video edits":"Video edits","Edits that hold attention.":"Aise edits jo <em>nazar rok dein.</em>","All edits":"Saare edits","Graphics":"Graphics","Design with a point of view.":"Design jisme <em>soch dikhe.</em>","All graphics":"Saare graphics","Code & AI":"Code aur AI","Code, AI and real products.":"Code, AI aur <em>asli products.</em>","All projects":"Saare projects","Screenshots coming soon":"Screenshots jaldi aa rahe","Websites":"Websites","Websites that open fast and sell.":"Websites jo <em>jaldi khulein</em> aur bechein.","All websites":"Saari websites","Services":"Services","What we can build for you.":"Hum aapke liye <em>kya bana sakte hain.</em>","From a single reel to a full app with an owner panel — pick a service, ask for the price, and we start.":"Ek reel se lekar owner panel wale poore app tak — service chuno, price pucho, aur kaam shuru.","See all services":"Saari services dekho","Contact":"Contact","Let's build something beyond imagination.":"Chalo kuch <em>soch se aage</em> banate hain.","Contact page":"Contact page","Start a project":"Project shuru karo","Let's build":"Chalo banate hain","Have an idea? Let's make it real.":"Idea hai? <em>Chalo sach karte hain.</em>","Beyond Imagination":"Soch se aage","Navigate":"Pages","Text size":"Text ka size","Reduce motion":"Animation kam karo","Calmer page, fewer animations":"Shaant page, kam animation","Language":"Bhasha","Reset to default":"Pehle jaisa karo","Skip to content":"Seedha content par jao","Home":"Home","What it does":"Kya karta hai","How we work":"Hum kaise kaam karte hain","From idea to launch":"Idea se <em>launch tak</em>","Next step":"Agla kadam","Talk to us":"Baat karo","Listen":"Sunna","Plan":"Plan","Build":"Banana","Launch & care":"Launch aur dekhbhal","We start with a short call or chat to understand the goal, the audience and the deadline.":"Pehle chhoti call ya chat — goal, audience aur deadline samajhte hain.","A clear plan with scope, look and timeline, so you know exactly what you will get.":"Saaf plan — kya banega, kaisa dikhega, kab tak. Sab pehle se pata.","Design and build in small steps, with previews you can check on your own phone.":"Chhote steps mein design aur build, har step ka preview aapke phone par.","We go live, test on every screen, and stay around for fixes and updates.":"Live karte hain, har screen par test, aur baad mein bhi fixes aur updates.","Send a message":"Message bhejo","Your name":"Aapka naam","Email (optional)":"Email (zaroori nahi)","What do you need?":"Kya chahiye?","Message":"Message","Send on WhatsApp":"WhatsApp par bhejo","This opens WhatsApp with your message ready. Nothing is stored on this website.":"Isse WhatsApp khulega, message taiyaar milega. Website par kuch save nahi hota.","Location":"Jagah","Reply time":"Reply kab tak","Usually within a few hours":"Aksar kuch ghanton mein","Ask for price":"Price pucho","Prices depend on the work — ask on WhatsApp and you get a clear quote first.":"Price kaam par depend karta hai — WhatsApp par pucho, pehle saaf quote milega.","Open live":"Live kholo","Visit site":"Site kholo","See the work":"Kaam dekho","Story":"Kahani","Skills":"Skills","Portfolio":"Portfolio","All":"Sab","Previous":"Pichla","Next":"Agla","Coming soon":"Jaldi aa raha hai","In development":"Ban raha hai","This page went beyond imagination.":"Ye page soch se bhi aage chala gaya.","Back to home":"Home par wapas","The link may be old or mistyped. Let's take you somewhere real.":"Link purana ya galat ho sakta hai. Chalo sahi jagah le chalte hain.","Android AI app by QENLYX":"QENLYX ka Android AI app","Mxa AI is a personal AI assistant for Android, made in Dhanbad. Talk or type in Hinglish or your own language — it understands your photos, videos and PDFs, and remembers what you choose to save.":"Mxa AI Android ke liye tumhara personal AI assistant hai, Dhanbad me bana. Hinglish ya apni bhasha me bolo ya likho — ye tumhari photo, video aur PDF samajhta hai, aur jo tum save karo wo yaad rakhta hai.","See features":"Features dekho","The 3-second launch animation — a preview rendered from the app's real logo and timing.":"3 second ka launch animation — app ke asli logo aur timing se bana preview.","A look inside.":"Andar ki <em>jhalak.</em>","Preview screens from the app in development, with demo data. Tap any screen to view it large.":"App ki preview screens (demo data ke saath), abhi ban raha hai. Kisi bhi screen pe tap karke bada dekho.","Everything you need, in one app.":"Sab kuchh, <em>ek hi app me.</em>","Privacy, simply":"Privacy, seedhi baat","Your profile stays on your phone. Only your name and city go to the AI so it can talk to you personally — your phone number and email are never sent. Keys stay locked in the Vault.":"Tumhari profile tumhare phone me rehti hai. AI ko sirf tumhara naam aur city jaata hai taaki wo tumse personal baat kar sake — phone number aur email kabhi nahi jaate. Keys Vault me lock rehti hain.","Download jaldi aa raha hai.":"Download <em>jaldi aa raha hai.</em>","Mxa AI is being built and tested right now. The download link will be here as soon as it is ready.":"Mxa AI abhi ban raha hai aur test ho raha hai. Ready hote hi download link yahin milega.","Made by":"Banaya","Preview":"Preview","Features":"Features","Download":"Download","Hinglish + 18 languages":"Hinglish + 18 bhashayein","Replies in Hinglish by default. Switch to Hindi, English and other Indian and world languages — 18 in all.":"Default me Hinglish me jawab. Jab chaho Hindi, English ya doosri Indian aur world languages pe switch karo — kul 18.","Voice input":"Bolke likho","Tap the mic and just speak. Mxa turns your voice into a message for you.":"Mic dabao aur bolo. Mxa tumhari awaaz ko message bana deta hai.","Photos, videos & PDFs":"Photo, video aur PDF","Attach a photo, a video or a PDF and ask about it — Mxa reads it and answers.":"Photo, video ya PDF lagao aur uske baare me poochho — Mxa padhke jawab deta hai.","Floating Mxa":"Floating Mxa","Turn it on and Mxa floats over your screen as a small bubble, ready on any app. Turn it off and it's gone.":"On karo to Mxa screen pe chhota bubble ban ke kisi bhi app ke upar ready rehta hai. Off karo to gayab.","Projects & My Files":"Projects aur My Files","Group chats and files into Projects with their own instructions. Every file you upload stays in My Files.":"Chats aur files ko apni instructions ke saath Projects me rakho. Jo bhi file upload karo, My Files me milegi.","Saved memory":"Saved memory","Save things about you in simple categories. Mxa reads them to answer better — switch it off anytime.":"Apne baare me categories me save karo. Mxa unhe padhke behtar jawab deta hai — jab chaho off karo.","Secure Vault":"Secure Vault","Your API keys are locked in the Vault with Android Keystore encryption, on your own phone.":"Tumhari API keys Vault me Android Keystore encryption ke saath, tumhare hi phone me lock rehti hain.","Personal profile":"Personal profile","Add your name and photo. Mxa greets you by your name and speaks to you personally.":"Naam aur photo daalo. Mxa tumhe tumhare naam se bulata hai aur personal baat karta hai.","Themes":"Themes","Many looks for the home and chat screens, with a new theme to discover every day.":"Home aur chat screen ke liye bahut saare look, aur roz ek naya theme."}};